# Instagram Import and Full Photo Archive

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: M1 Recover available owner-uploaded media
Dependencies: Supplied export imported; full-account history reconciliation remains unverified

## Purpose

Collect actual uploaded media without screenshots, credentials or rate-limit bypasses.

## Tasks

- [x] Attempt bounded public retrieval of @homemadevegcakes.
- [x] Stop on HTTP 429 with zero downloaded photos; no credential access or retry loop.
- [x] Write the owner-export guide.
- [x] Implement offline ZIP, multiple ZIP and extracted-directory input.
- [x] Include eligible carousel files, SHA256 deduplication and source associations.
- [x] Exclude messages/profile data and reject unsafe paths or output conflicts.
- [x] Exercise importer behavior with synthetic unittest fixtures.
- [ ] Request all-time, highest-quality owner posts/content export when accessible.
- [x] Receive and process the supplied extracted export path without requiring repacking.
- [x] Run against the real export and reconcile counts, duplicate associations and exclusions.
- [ ] Inspect any unsupported export layout instead of silently claiming completion.
- [ ] Compare recovered media with account history without confusing posts and images.
- [ ] Identify higher-quality replacements for screenshots by visual review.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] The user can provide only an extracted-folder path; repacking is unnecessary.
- [x] No account credentials or network connection are required by the importer.
- [x] Zero eligible files is an actionable error, not success.
- [x] Real-export compatibility is established for the supplied account export.
- [x] Archive completeness claims are scoped to the provided export, not all time
  on Instagram; deleted/expired/unselected media cannot be promised.

## Completion evidence

- The later bounded posts-only review is tracked in workstream 15: 159 files,
  153 distinct hashes, six duplicate entries, seven prior website sources and
  146 not-yet-reviewed images on nine contact sheets. These narrower counts do
  not replace the whole-export import counts below or prove account completeness.
- ..\scripts\import_instagram.py and ..\tests\test_import_instagram.py.
- Parent ran 28 passing synthetic unittest cases, including an extracted folder
  with wrapper directories. No real account media was imported by those tests.
- Guide: ..\docs\instagram-photo-import.md.
- Actual import: 178 scanned files, 167 eligible entries, 160 unique originals,
  seven duplicates and 11 exclusions (seven outside scope, three videos disabled,
  one unsupported extension). Manifest: ..\.local\instagram\imported\manifest.json.
- Seven visually curated designs use metadata-free public derivatives and retain
  original hashes/crops. No signed-in account-history comparison was performed.

## Completion log

- 2026-10-04 - Successfully imported the supplied real export offline, including
  nested dated media folders. Preserved original bytes and duplicate associations.
  Seven reviewed cake photos supplement the original five screenshots for the
  notebook; other media and all account archives remain private.
- 2026-10-04 - Public retrieval blocked; isolated downloader environment removed.
  Offline import tooling completed. Real retrieval is deferred until an export
  exists; prototype screenshot work proceeds separately.
